REMARK   1  TITL   NUCLEAR MAGNETIC RESONANCE CHARACTERIZATION OF THE           
REMARK   1  TITL 2 N-TERMINAL THIOREDOXIN-LIKE DOMAIN OF PROTEIN DISULFIDE      
REMARK   1  TITL 3 ISOMERASE                                                    
REMARK   1  REF    PROTEIN SCI.                  V.   4  2587 1995              
